    "content": "## HL · Listening post: 18:00 summary (Lesson 5.3)\nItems with level today (negative, confidence 0.8 or more, refund or late delivery) are sent to Tolu in one message at 6 p.m., then marked alerted.\n\nCredentials: Google Sheets; Telegram.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
